@startuml
!theme plain
title Data Flow Diagram (DFD Level 1)

actor "Data Engineer" as Dev
actor "BI Analyst" as Analyst

rectangle "Raw Layer" as Raw {
  database "ecommerce_behavior.csv" as CSV
}

rectangle "Processing Layer" as ETL {
  component "load_raw.py"
  component "clean_staging.py"
  component "create_marts.py"
}

rectangle "Staging Layer" as Staging {
  database "cleaned_data.parquet"
}

rectangle "Data Mart Layer" as Mart {
  database "dim_users.csv"
  database "dim_products.csv"
  database "dim_categories.csv"
  database "fact_events.csv"
}

rectangle "BI Layer" as BI {
  component "Power BI / Superset"
}

Dev --> CSV : Загружает данные
CSV --> load_raw.py : Проверка и загрузка
load_raw.py --> clean_staging.py : Передача пути
clean_staging.py --> cleaned_data.parquet : Очистка чанками
clean_staging.py --> create_marts.py : Запуск следующего шага
create_marts.py --> Mart : Формирование витрин
Mart --> BI : Передача данных для визуализации
Analyst --> BI : Аналитика, отчёты

@enduml
